  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This humanitarian and resilience investment supports the Solomon Islands Government to improve their responses to disaster across Solomon Islands. Support is through national responses during disasters, capacity development of national personnel in disaster management, meteorology and management of seismic risks and improvement of small-scale infrastructure</narrative>
  </description>
